&lt;h1 id="andalucías-capital-city"&gt;Andalucía&amp;rsquo;s Capital City&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Welcome to Sevilla! Home of the filming of scenes from Game of Thrones, Star Wars, Knight and Day, and Laurence of Arabia. Sevilla is the city that has the most orange trees in Spain (not so delicious to eat). Sevilla was also where Christopher Columbus was laid to rest. Sevilla is a captivating city of Andalucía.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Salamanca, Spain</title><link>https://blogbirdeyeview.github.io/posts/spain/salamanca/</link><pubDate>Sun, 22 Jan 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blogbirdeyeview.github.io/posts/spain/salamanca/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="salamanca-spain"&gt;Salamanca, Spain&lt;/h1&gt;
