&lt;h1 id="a-perfect-destination"&gt;A Perfect Destination&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salamanca is one of the oldest founded cities in Spain and is home to the 3rd oldest university in the world. A little west of Madrid is where you can find this quaint Spanish city. Enjoy the ambiance of this small, historical town while traveling through Spain.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Bilbao, Spain</title><link>https://blogbirdeyeview.github.io/posts/spain/bilbao/</link><pubDate>Sun, 07 May 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blogbirdeyeview.github.io/posts/spain/bilbao/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="bilbao-spain"&gt;Bilbao, Spain&lt;/h1&gt;
