&lt;p&gt;Did you know that Bilbao has 2 official languages? Here you will find people speaking Spanish AND Basque (Euskera). The Basque language is very different from Spanish and any other language. But, no worries. Everyone in the city center will also speak Spanish and some even English. So… pack your bags and welcome to Bilbao.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Malaga, Spain</title><link>https://blogbirdeyeview.github.io/posts/spain/malaga/</link><pubDate>Sun, 07 May 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blogbirdeyeview.github.io/posts/spain/malaga/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="málaga-spain"&gt;Málaga, Spain&lt;/h1&gt;
